<title>CHINA: China interbank market rates (CHIBOR) mostly down.</title>
<headline>China interbank market rates (CHIBOR) mostly down.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the China Interbank Offered Rate (CHIBOR) for Wednesday issued by the official Xinhua news agency on behalf of the People's Bank of China, the central bank.</p>
<p>The figures represent weighted averages and not closing prices and are annual percentage rates.</p>
<p>		 1DAY   7DAY  20DAY  30DAY  60DAY  90DAY  120DAY</p>
<p>WEDNESDAY  10.872 12.239 11.033 11.220 11.295 11.344 11.293</p>
<p> TUESDAY    10.922 11.171 11.059 11.208 11.337 11.568 11.478</p>
<p>Turnover fell to 2.348 billion yuan from 3.137 billion yuan with the 90-day contract the most actively traded.</p>
</text>
